# Generated art derivatives (§10.6: the 512 px "slide" + 128 px "thumb" renditions the server derives
# from the shipped placeholder pack). Output, not input: the pack under Public/Assets/Images is the
# source of truth, the server re-derives any missing or stale rendition at boot from its manifest, and
# committing them would add ~43 MB of bytes that any machine reproduces from the same inputs.
Public/Assets/Generated/

